Role Overview:
The Systems Engineer will support EU MDR 2017/745 remediation programs for Class I, II and III medical devices. The role involves gap assessment, design control remediation, requirements engineering, traceability management, risk management, technical documentation updates, and cross-functional collaboration to ensure compliance with EU MDR, ISO 13485, ISO 14971 and applicable product standards.
