n lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">2</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">Qualification Criteria- BE/BTECH</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif; background:yellow">Mandatory Skills</span></b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif; background:yellow"> – Altium Designer</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">( 5+ years’ experience)</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal"><b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">ONLY IMMEDIATE JOINERS REQUIRED</span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal"><b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal"><b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">TPC Rates –</span></b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif"> 1,30,000</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">Work Location – Pune</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">Job Description</span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">PCB Designer with 6+ years of hands-on experience in Altium Designer to develop high-performance PCB layouts for power electronic and high Speed applications. </span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">Expertise in multilayer PCB design, power supply layouts, DC-DC converters, AC-DC converters, motor control systems, LED drivers, battery management systems, and mixed-signal designs. </span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><b><span style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">Key Responsibilities: </span></b><span style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif"></span></p><ul type="disc" style="margin-top:0cm"><li class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:0cm"><span style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">Design and develop 2-layer to 16-layer PCB layouts using Altium Designer and Xpedition at Pune location.</span></li><li class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:0cm"><span style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">Create and maintain PCB footprints, schematic symbols, and component libraries following IPC standards.</span></li><li class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:0cm"><span style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">Perform component placement considering thermal, electrical, mechanical, and manufacturability requirements.</span></li><li class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:0cm"><span style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">Design high-current and high-voltage PCBs with proper creepage and clearance requirements.</span></li><li class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:0cm"><span style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">Layout power electronics circuits such as: AC/DC Power Supplies, DC/DC Converters, Motor Drives, Battery Charging Systems, LED Drivers and Inverters and Power Control Boards</span></li><li class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:0cm"><span style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">Implement EMI/EMC design practices during placement and routing.</span></li><li class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:0cm"><span style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">Perform controlled impedance routing and differential pair routing where required.</span></li><li class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:0cm"><span style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">Multilayer PCB Design, High Current &amp; High Voltage Layouts, Mixed Signal PCB Design, Thermal Management Techniques, Copper Pour Optimization and HDI, Blind/Buried Vias</span></li><li class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:0cm"><span style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">Generate manufacturing outputs including: ODB++, IPC-2581, Assembly Drawings, Fabrication Drawings, Pick &amp; Place Files, BOM Documentation.</span></li><li class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:0cm"><span style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">Conduct design reviews and resolve DFM, DFA, and DFT issues.</span></li><li class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:0cm"><span style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">Work with PCB fabrication and assembly vendors for successful product realization.</span></li><li class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:0cm"><span style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">Manage ECOs and design revisions throughout the product lifecycle.</span></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><b><span style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal"><b><span style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">Required Technical Skills: EDA Tools</span></b><span style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif"></span></p><ul type="disc" style="margin-top:0cm"><li class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:0cm"><span style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">Altium Designer (Expert Level)</span></li><li class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:0cm"><span style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">CAM350 / Gerber Viewer Tools</span></li><li class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:0cm"><span style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">Knowledge of Cadence Allegro or Xpedition is an added advantage.</span></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><b><span style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal"><b><span style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">Educational Qualification</span></b></p><ul type="disc" style="margin-top:0cm"><li class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:0cm"><span style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">B.E / B.Tech in Electronics &amp; Communication, Electrical &amp; Electronics, Instrumentation or related discipline.</span></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNorm