ONLY IMMEDIATE JOINERS REQUIRED
Work location -
Bangalore
Details JD-
Experienced Scrum Master with 7-12 years of overall experience with minimum 5 years of strong background exp in Agile delivery(SAFe Framework), team facilitation, stakeholder management, and continuous improvement. The candidate will be responsible for driving best Agile practices, facilitating Scrum ceremonies, removing impediments, managing dependencies, and enabling teams to deliver business value effectively.
Key Responsibilities:
Facilitate Scrum ceremonies including Sprint Planning, Daily Stand-ups, Reviews, Retrospectives, and Backlog Refinement.
Coach teams on Agile/Scrum best practices and foster a culture of continuous improvement.
Collaborate with Product Owners, Architects, and stakeholders to align priorities and delivery goals.
Identify and remove impediments, risks, and dependencies impacting delivery.
Track Agile metrics such as Velocity, Burndown, Capacity, Lead Time, and Cycle Time.
Drive cross-functional team collaboration and release planning.
Support Agile transformation initiatives and delivery governance.
Required Skills
Strong hands-on experience as a Scrum Master in Agile environments.
Expertise in SAFe Agile Framework, Scrum, and Kanban.
Agile coaching, stakeholder management, risk management, and team facilitation.
Experience managing multiple Agile teams and coordinating cross-team dependencies.
Strong communication, leadership, and problem-solving skills.
Proficiency in Jira, Confluence, MS Teams, and SharePoint.
Certifications(Prefered)
SAFe Scrum Master (SSM) / SAFe Agilist Certification (Preferred)
SCM Certification (Scrum Master Certified) would be an added advantage.
Best Regards,
Kallol Chakraborty
