.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">Open Positions- 1</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">Qualification Criteria -</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif"> <b>BE/BTech</b></span><b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif"></span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal"><b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">Any domain specification: <b>medical domain</b></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">Mandatory Skills –</span><b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif"> Scrum Master</span></b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">Bill Rate per month for TPC (in terms of INR)- </span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">125000 – </span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif; color:black">130000</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif; color:black"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif; color:black">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif; background:yellow">ONLY IMMEDIATE JOINERS REQUIRED</span></b><b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif"></span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif; color:black">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">Work location - </span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">Bangalore </span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif"></span></p><p class="MsoListParagraph"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; line-height:115%; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">Details JD-</span></p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; line-height:115%; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><ul type="disc" style="margin-top:0cm"><li class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle" style="margin-left:0cm"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; line-height:115%; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">Experienced Scrum Master with 7-12 years of overall experience with minimum 5 years of strong background exp in Agile delivery(SAFe Framework), team facilitation, stakeholder management, and continuous improvement. The candidate will be responsible for driving best Agile practices, facilitating Scrum ceremonies, removing impediments, managing dependencies, and enabling teams to deliver business value effectively.</span></li><li class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle" style="margin-left:0cm"><b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; line-height:115%; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">Key Responsibilities:</span></b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; line-height:115%; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif"><br>Facilitate Scrum ceremonies including Sprint Planning, Daily Stand-ups, Reviews, Retrospectives, and Backlog Refinement.<br>Coach teams on Agile/Scrum best practices and foster a culture of continuous improvement.<br>Collaborate with Product Owners, Architects, and stakeholders to align priorities and delivery goals.<br>Identify and remove impediments, risks, and dependencies impacting delivery.<br>Track Agile metrics such as Velocity, Burndown, Capacity, Lead Time, and Cycle Time.<br>Drive cross-functional team collaboration and release planning.<br>Support Agile transformation initiatives and delivery governance.</span></li><li class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle" style="margin-left:0cm"><b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; line-height:115%; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">Required Skills</span></b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; line-height:115%; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif"><br>Strong hands-on experience as a Scrum Master in Agile environments.<br>Expertise in SAFe Agile Framework, Scrum, and Kanban.&nbsp;<br>Agile coaching, stakeholder management, risk management, and team facilitation.<br>Experience managing multiple Agile teams and coordinating cross-team dependencies.<br>Strong communication, leadership, and problem-solving skills.<br>Proficiency in Jira, Confluence, MS Teams, and SharePoint.</span></li><li class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast" style="margin-left:0cm"><b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; line-height:115%; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">Certifications(Prefered)</span></b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; line-height:115%; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif"><br>SAFe Scrum Master (SSM) / SAFe Agilist Certification (Preferred)<br>SCM Certification (Scrum Master Certified) would be an added advantage.</span></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-left:18.0pt"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:4.0pt"><b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:4.0pt"><b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:4.0pt"><b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:4.0pt"><b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:9.0pt; font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,sans-serif; color:#004B88">Best Regards,</span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:4.0pt"><b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:9.0pt; font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,sans-serif; color:#004B88">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:4.0pt; line-height:115%"><b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:9.0pt; line-height:115%; font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,sans-serif; color:#004B88">Kallol Chakraborty</span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height:150%"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:9.0pt; line-height:150%; font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,sans-serif">Talent Acquisition</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:9.0pt; font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,sans-serif"><img border="0" width="330" height="2" id="Picture_x0020_11" src="cid:image001.png@01DCEA1A.61A736B0" style="width:3.4375in; height:.0208in"></span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:9.0pt; fo