;,sans-serif">Years of Exp – 5- 8 Years</span></p><p class="elementtoproof"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="elementtoproof"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">TPC Rate card &nbsp;- 1.4L </span></p><p class="elementtoproof"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="elementtoproof"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">Work location – Bangalore &nbsp;</span></p><p class="elementtoproof"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="elementtoproof"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif; color:black">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="elementtoproof"><b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif; color:black; background:yellow">Mandatory skills – </span></b><b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif; color:black"></span></b></p><ul type="disc" style="margin-top:0cm"><li class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:0cm"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">Strong hands-on experience in <b>Mobile Automation Testing using Appium</b> (primary requirement), with <b>UI Automation using Selenium</b> as an added advantage.</span></li><li class="elementtoproof" style=""><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">Strong expertise in <b>API Automation </b>&nbsp;(primary requirement), with <b>UI Automation using Selenium</b> as a good-to-have skill<b></b></span></li></ul><p class="elementtoproof"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_Hlk132029928"><b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">Job Description:</span></b></a></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style=""><b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></b></span></p><span style=""></span><ul type="disc" style="margin-top:0cm"><li class="MsoNormal" style=""><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">5+ years of experience in software testing and test automation.</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif"></span></li><li class="MsoNormal" style=""><b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">Strong programming skills in C#. atleast 4+years <i>(Mandatory)</i></span></b></li><li class="MsoNormal" style=""><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">Expertise in Appium for cross-platform mobile automation. <i>(Mandatory)</i></span></li><li class="MsoNormal" style=""><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">Experience with Android automation (UiAutomator) and iOS automation (XCUITest).<i> (Mandatory)</i></span></li><li class="MsoNormal" style=""><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">Hands-on experience with Selenium WebDriver for web automation. <i>(Mandatory)</i></span></li><li class="MsoNormal" style=""><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">Solid understanding of REST API testing (tools like Postman/RestSharp or equivalent).<i> (Mandatory)</i></span></li><li class="MsoNormal" style=""><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">Proficient in OOP concepts, design patterns, and test framework architecture. <i>(Mandatory)</i></span></li><li class="MsoNormal" style=""><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">Strong experience in automation frameworks and design patterns: <i>(Anyone framework)</i></span></li><ul type="circle" style="margin-top:0cm"><li class="MsoNormal" style=""><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">Page Object Model (POM)</span></li><li class="MsoNormal" style=""><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">Behavior-Driven Development (BDD) – SpecFlow/Cucumber</span></li><li class="MsoNormal" style=""><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">Data-driven frameworks</span></li></ul><li class="MsoNormal" style=""><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">Experience in test execution, defect tracking, and reporting. <i>(Mandatory)</i></span></li><li class="MsoNormal" style=""><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">Exposure to CI/CD tools like Azure DevOps, Jenkins, or similar. <i>(Good to have)</i></span></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">Knowledge of version control systems (Git). <i>(Basic knowlwdge</i></span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif; color:#004B88">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:4.0pt"><b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quo