Domain Specific: PLM
Overall Experience: 6-10 Years
Relevant Experience: 6-10 Years
Mandatory Skills: Dassault Systèmes 3DEXPERIENCE platform (ENOVIA, CATIA, DELMIA) , PLM architecture , data modeling, CAD/CAE
