Key Responsibilities:
The 3DX Architect is responsible for designing, implementing, and optimizing solutions on the Dassault Systèmes 3DEXPERIENCE platform. This role ensures that the platform architecture aligns with business processes, engineering requirements, and enterprise IT standards.
Strong knowledge of Dassault Systèmes 3DEXPERIENCE platform (ENOVIA, CATIA, DELMIA).
Experience in PLM architecture and implementation.
Proficiency in data modeling, workflows, and lifecycle management.
Familiarity with integration technologies (web services, APIs).
Understanding of CAD/CAE tools and engineering processes.
Excellent problem-solving and communication skills.
