Job Summary:
We are looking for an experienced and highly skilled Intershop Back-End Developer. The ideal candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, and maintaining robust back-end solutions using the Intershop Commerce Suite. This role requires a deep understanding of Java, Intershop architecture, REST APIs, and e-commerce best practices.
Key Responsibilities:
• Work as back-end developer on Intershop-based e-commerce solutions.
• Design, implement, and optimize scalable and high-performance back-end modules using Intershop Commerce Suite (ISM).
• Collaborate with front-end teams, business analysts, and solution architects to ensure seamless integration and delivery.
• Create and maintain technical documentation, development standards, and best practices.
• Participate in code reviews, unit testing, and performance tuning.
• Ensure adherence to security standards and data protection regulations.
Required Skills & Qualifications:
•
3+ years of hands-on experience with Intershop Commerce Suite (7.x / 11.x).
Thanks & regards,
Vaishnavi
Lead-Talent Acquisition
