t; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"></span></p><p class="xxxmsonormal"><b><span style="font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif; background:yellow">Location – Pune , Chennai only</span></b><b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"></span></b></p><p class="xxxmsonormal"><span style="font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"></span></p><p class="xxxmsonormal"><span style="font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Overall exp&nbsp;– 5 – 8 years</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"></span></p><p class="xxxmsonormal"><span style="font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"></span></p><p class="xxxmsonormal"><span style="font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Open Positions- 1</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"></span></p><p class="xxxmsonormal"><span style="font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"></span></p><p class="xxxmsonormal"><span style="font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Qualification Criteria- <span style="color:black; background:yellow">B.E Electrical</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"></span></p><p class="xxxmsonormal"><span style="font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"></span></p><p class="xxxmsonormal"><span style="font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calib