Job Description:
We are looking for an Avalonia Developer (2-3 years experienced person) who will play a key role in designing and developing intuitive desktop applications using Avalonia. The responsibilities include:
Key Responsibilities:
§ Develop and enhance features within an existing desktop application.
§ Customize and extend C#/.NET/Avalonia-based UI components and integrate them with an existing Windows application.
§ Collaborate closely with the extended team to understand customer requirements and address key pain points.
Required Qualifications:
§ Strong proficiency in Avalonia/AXAML or WPF/XAML for desktop application development.
§ Experience implementing user interfaces based on Figma designs.
Preferred Skills:
§ Good understanding of design patterns, C#, object-oriented programming (OOP), SOA, and SOLID principles.
§ Familiarity with multi-threaded, real-time GUI development.
§ Experience working on Human-Machine Interface (HMI) projects.
Best Regards,
