Experience in developing test applications, measurement, and automation in aero domain
Must have hands-on experience in NI LabView, NI DAQ, and instrument control/Data acquisition systems
Experience in automated test systems, hardware interfacing and troubleshooting LabVIEW based applications
Must have worked with communication protocols such as CAN, ARINC, RS-232, TCP/IP and Modbus
Experience with Test stand/Veristand. PLC/Sensor integration and test environments in aerospace automotive and Manufacturing is preferred.
Qualification: BE/BTech in electronics, electrical, instrumentation or related field, CLAD/CLD is an advantage.
Best Regards,
Kallol Chakraborty
Talent Acquisition
