4; background:white"><span style="font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Support board bring-up, hardware validation, and debugging.</span></li><li class="MsoNormal" style="color:#242424; background:white"><span style="font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Containerize robotics workloads using Docker where applicable.</span></li><li class="MsoNormal" style="color:#242424; background:white"><span style="font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Collaborate with AI, perception, navigation, and controls teams.</span></li><li class="MsoNormal" style="color:#242424; background:white"><span style="font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Implement CI/CD pipelines for Yocto image generation and software validation.</span></li><li class="MsoNormal" style="color:#242424; background:white"><span style="font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Support deployment and OTA update mechanisms.</span></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif; color:#242424">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:4.0pt"><b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:9.0pt; font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,sans-serif; color:#004B88">Best Regards,</span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:4.0pt"><b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:9.0pt; font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,sans-serif; color:#004B88">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:4.0pt; line-height:115%"><b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:9.0pt; line-height:115%; font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,sans-serif; color:#004B88">Kallol Chakraborty</span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height:150%"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:9.0pt; line-height:150%; font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,sans-serif">