y:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height:120%"><b><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif; color:black">Experience</span></b><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif; color:black"></span></p><ul type="disc"><li class="MsoNormal" style="color:black; line-height:105%"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">5+ years of experience Embedded Systems testing, quality assurance, and end-to-end System Integration Testing.</span></li><li class="MsoNormal" style="color:black"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Proven experience with Python, with Automation Frameworks like PyTest, Robot framework, Selenium, API Testing, etc.</span></li><li class="MsoNormal" style="color:black; line-height:105%"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Strong knowledge of embedded systems testing integration testing, subsystem validation, defect analysis, and release quality assurance.</span></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height:120%"><b><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif; color:black">Technical Skills</span></b><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif; color:black"></span></p><ul type="disc"><li class="MsoNormal" style="color:black"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Proficiency in developing automated test scripts using Python.</span></li><li class="MsoNormal" style="color:black; line-height:105%"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Experience with embedded system development/testing tools, integration test benches, simulators, HIL/SIL environments, and debugging instruments.</span></li><li class="MsoNormal" style="color:black; line-height:105%"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Experience in Web automation testing and UI testing.</span></li><li class="MsoNormal" style="color:black"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Fami