toproof" style="background:white">&nbsp;</p><p class="elementtoproof" style="background:white"><span class="spanwithbackgroundcolor"><span style="font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif; color:black; background:yellow">Any domain specification- Automotive Interiors</span></span></p><p class="elementtoproof" style="background:white">&nbsp;</p><p class="elementtoproof" style="background:white"><span style="font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif; color:black">Qualification Criteria- BE/B.Tech</span></p><p class="elementtoproof" style="background:white">&nbsp;</p><p class="elementtoproof" style="background:white"><span style="font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif; color:black">Mandatory Skills- NX, Automotive Interiors</span></p><p class="elementtoproof" style="background:white">&nbsp;</p><p class="elementtoproof" style="background:white"><span style="font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif; color:black">Work location- Chennai/Pune</span></p><p class="elementtoproof" style="background:white">&nbsp;</p><p class="elementtoproof" style="background:white"><span style="font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif; color:black">Bill rate- 140000/month</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:11.0pt; color:black">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><b><span style="font-size:11.0pt; color:black">Detailed JD: </span></b><span style="font-size:11.0pt; color:black">Interior trims</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:11.0pt; color:black">&nbsp;</span></p><ul type="disc" style="margin-top:0cm"><li class="MsoNormal" style="color:#242424; background:white">Design and Development experience on CPM/Console (Plastic) parts .</li><li class="MsoNormal" style="color:#242424; background:white">Take full ownership of the parts.</li><li class="MsoNormal" style="color:#242424; background:white">Experience 4-8 years.</li><li class="MsoNormal" style="color:#242424