ns- 1 position</span><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"></span></p><p class="elementtoproof"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"></span></p><p class="elementtoproof"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Years of Exp – <b>4 - 7 years</b></span><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"></span></p><p class="elementtoproof"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"></span></p><p class="elementtoproof"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Qualification – BE / B Tech - Electronics </span><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"></span></p><p class="elementtoproof"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"></span></p><p class="elementtoproof"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Bill Rate per month for TPC (in terms of INR)- </span><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"></span></p><p class="elementtoproof"><b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></b><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"></span></p><p class="elementtoproof"><b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">4 – 5 yrs – 1.4 L</span></b></p><p class="elementtoproof"><b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">5 – 6 yrs – 1.65 L</span></b><b><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"></span></b></p><p class="elementtoproof"><b><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">6 - 8 yrs</span></b><b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif"> - 1.88 L</span></b><b><span style="font-family: