uot;,sans-serif">Qualification Criteria- BE. Btech</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Aptos Narrow&quot;,sans-serif"><br>Open Positions – 2</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Aptos Narrow&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Aptos Narrow&quot;,sans-serif; background:yellow">ONLY IMMEDIATE JOINERS REQUIRED</span></b><b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Aptos Narrow&quot;,sans-serif"></span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal"><b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Aptos Narrow&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Aptos Narrow&quot;,sans-serif">Work Location – Bangalore</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Aptos Narrow&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Aptos Narrow&quot;,sans-serif">Bill Rate – 120000 – 140000</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Aptos Narrow&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Aptos Narrow&quot;,sans-serif">Job Description:</span></b></p><p class="xmsonormal" style="margin:0cm"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Aptos Narrow&quot;,sans-serif; color:black">§ Bachelor's or master’s degree in Electronics Engineering with 6+ years of relevant industry experience and a strong academic background.<br>§ Solid understanding of digital electronics, analog circuits, and CMOS device fundamentals.<br>§ <b>Hands-on experience with NI-based ATE platforms</b>, <b>preferably NI STS (GP3), with test development experience using LabVIEW and/or C#.</b><br>§ <b>Strong programming skills in C# (mandatory</b>) and C++.<br>§ Experience in testing and characterization of mixed-signal devices such as ADCs, DACs, amplifiers, and related signal-chain products.<br>§ Familiarity with production test development, debug, characterization, correlation, and multisite optimization will be an added advantage.<br>Note:<br>o GP4 is the configuration we are looking at.<br>o LABVIEW will not be used, but we will need C# experience, and it is mandatory.</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Aptos Narrow&quot;,sans-serif"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Aptos Narrow&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal"><b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal"><b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal"><b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:4.0pt"><b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:9.0pt; font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,sans-serif; color:#004B88">Best Regards,</span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:4.0pt"><b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:9.0pt; font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,sans-serif; color:#004B88">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:4.0pt; line-height:115%"><b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:9.0pt; line-height:115%; font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,sans-serif; color:#004B88">Kallol Chakraborty</span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height:150%"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:9.0pt; line-height:150%; font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,sans-serif">Talent Acquisition</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:9.0pt; font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,sans-serif"><img border="0" width="330" height="2" id="Picture_x0020_11" src="cid:image001.png@01DCEA1A.61A736B0" style="width:3.4375in; height:.